{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfcfb;--ink:#0b2540;--accent:#6aa84f;--muted:#5b6b74;--card:#ffffff}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.45}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(106,168,79,0.06),transparent)}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#8ccf66);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:15px}
    nav a.current{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:22px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .hero-card{background:var(--card);padding:28px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(12,24,36,0.06)}
    .hero h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px}
    .hero p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .values{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}
    .pill{background:rgba(106,168,79,0.08);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
    /* subtle patterned banner using inline SVG data URI (unique pattern) */
    .pattern-flag{height:100%;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(138,195,98,0.08),transparent),url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="200" height="200" viewBox="0 0 200 200"><defs><linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="%236aa84f" stop-opacity="0.12"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="%238ccf66" stop-opacity="0.04"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill="none" stroke="%236aa84f" stroke-opacity="0.08" stroke-width="1"><path d="M0 30 C40 10,80 50,120 30 C160 10,200 50,240 30" transform="translate(-20,-10)"/></g><circle cx="30" cy="30" r="2" fill="%236aa84f" fill-opacity="0.15"/><circle cx="70" cy="90" r="2" fill="%236aa84f" fill-opacity="0.12"/></svg>') center/cover no-repeat}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(10,20,30,0.03)}
    .session-planner{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#fbfff5);}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6ebe3;background:white}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    .cta-strip{margin-top:18px;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(106,168,79,0.08),rgba(140,207,102,0.04));display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    footer{max-width:980px;margin:26px auto;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .faq{margin-top:18px}
    .faq details{background:var(--card);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px}
    .print-hidden{display:none}
    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">WC</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html" class="current">Your Story</a>
      <a href="services.html">Pathways</a>
      <a href="programs.html">Journeys</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Pricing</a>
      <a href="testimonials.html">Wins</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <h1>About {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
        <p class="lead">I help curious people build daily habits that shape how they feel — practical frameworks, small actions, clear progress.</p>
        <div class="values">
          <div class="pill">Habit-first</div>
          <div class="pill">Outcome-led</div>
          <div class="pill">Human-centered</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px">We blend rhythm, reflection, and measurable mini-goals. No miracle promises — just a map and company as you try new things.</div>
        <div class="cta-strip">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">Start with a short session</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">A 30–45 minute clarity session to shape a first-week plan.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <a href="book.html" style="text-decoration:none"><button aria-label="Reserve">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="pattern-flag" style="padding:18px">
        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);padding:12px;border-radius:10px">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Snapshot</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:6px">Clients see clearer days, steadier routines, and a way to measure small wins.</div>
          <div class="grid" style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="card"><strong>4–6 weeks</strong><div class="muted">to new rhythm</div></div>
            <div class="card"><strong>3 anchors</strong><div class="muted">structure + habits + review</div></div>
            <div class="card"><strong>Flexible</strong><div class="muted">remote or local ({CITY}, {STATE})</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:22px">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">My approach — simple scaffolding</h2>
      <p class="muted">I use short frameworks that tie daily habits to measurable outcomes: start small, scale with feedback, protect what matters.</p>
      <div class="grid" style="margin-top:12px">
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Anchor Habits</strong>
          <div class="muted" style="margin-top:6px">Daily triggers that cue meaningful action — not lengthy chores.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Weekly Review</strong>
          <div class="muted" style="margin-top:6px">A 15-minute check to keep momentum aligned to goals.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Micro-experiments</strong>
          <div class="muted" style="margin-top:6px">Try small shifts, collect results, fold what's effective into habit.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:22px">
      <h3>Session planner</h3>
      <div class="hero-card session-planner">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <label for="goal">Primary goal (short):</label>
            <input id="goal" type="text" placeholder="e.g., sleep better, move daily, clear mornings">
            <label for="freq">Days per week you can commit:</label>
            <select id="freq"><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option><option>5+</option></select>
            <label for="length">Session length preference:</label>
            <select id="length"><option>30 minutes</option><option>45 minutes</option><option>60 minutes</option></select>
            <label for="support">Support style:</label>
            <select id="support"><option>Weekly check-ins</option><option>Biweekly coaching</option><option>Self-guided with feedback</option></select>
            <label for="notes">Any constraints or notes:</label>
            <textarea id="notes" rows="2" placeholder="times, equipment, energy, pets..."></textarea>
          </div>
          <div style="width:220px">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Plan preview</div>
            <pre id="planPreview" style="white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f6fff0;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px;height:180px;overflow:auto;border:1px solid rgba(106,168,79,0.08)"></pre>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px"><button id="buildPlan">Build plan</button><button id="copyPlan" style="background:#356859">Copy</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq">
      <h3>Questions people ask</h3>
      <details><summary>Is this a medical program?</summary><div style="padding-top:8px" class="muted">No. The work focuses on habits, time, and coping frameworks. It does not offer medical diagnosis or treatment.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How soon will I notice change?</summary><div style="padding-top:8px" class="muted">You may notice shifts in 1–3 weeks; stabilizing a habit often requires consistent review over 4–8 weeks.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Can I gift a session?</summary><div style="padding-top:8px" class="muted">Yes — reach out via {{EMAIL}} to arrange.</div></details>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px" class="hero-card">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Ready to start?</h3>
      <div class="muted">Book a short clarity session to try a seven-day habit jumpstart.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px"><a href="book.html" style="text-decoration:none"><button>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button></a></div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer>
    © <span id="yr"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <span class="muted">Reach: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></span>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('yr').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
    function build() {
      var goal = document.getElementById('goal').value || 'Clarify a small habit goal';
      var freq = document.getElementById('freq').value;
      var length = document.getElementById('length').value;
      var support = document.getElementById('support').value;
      var notes = document.getElementById('notes').value;
      var plan = [];
      plan.push('Plan for: ' + goal);
      plan.push('Commitment: ' + freq + ' days/week');
      plan.push('Session rhythm: ' + length + ' sessions; support: ' + support);
      plan.push('Starter micro-habits:');
      plan.push('- Anchor: choose one morning or evening cue (5 minutes)');
      plan.push('- Tiny win: 3–7 minutes of focused practice tied to your goal');
      plan.push('- Weekly review: 15 minutes to reflect and adjust');
      if (notes) plan.push('Notes: ' + notes);
      plan.push('Next step: Book a clarity session at ' + '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}');
      document.getElementById('planPreview').textContent = plan.join('\n');
    }
    document.getElementById('buildPlan').addEventListener('click', build);
    document.getElementById('copyPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var txt = document.getElementById('planPreview').textContent;
      if(!txt) build();
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('planPreview').textContent).then(function(){
        var b = document.createElement('button'); b.textContent = 'Copied'; b.style.background='#444'; b.style.color='#fff'; b.style.marginLeft='8px'; b.disabled=true; document.getElementById('copyPlan').after(b); setTimeout(function(){b.remove()},1400);
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"services.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Services — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fffefc;--ink:#102030;--accent:#d06aa5;--muted:#6b6f78}
    html,body{margin:0;padding:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg)}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(16,32,48,0.04)}
    .logo{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:26px auto;padding:16px}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(208,106,165,0.06),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:26px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .services{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
    .svc{flex:1;background:white;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(16,32,48,0.04)}
    .svc h3{margin:0 0 8px 0}
    .price{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    /* Habit builder widget */
    .habit-builder{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(208,106,165,0.06)}
    input,select,button{font:inherit}
    input[type=text]{width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #efe5ef}
    .checklist{margin-top:12px}
    .print-section{display:none}
    @media print{body *:not(.print-section){display:none} .print-section{display:block}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Your Story</a>
      <a href="services.html" aria-current="page">Pathways</a>
      <a href="programs.html">Journeys</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Pathways — how we work together</h1>
      <p class="muted">Practical session formats, each aimed at building the rhythms that move the needle. Pick what fits your life.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="services">
      <div class="svc">
        <h3>Guided Weeks</h3>
        <div class="muted" style="margin-bottom:8px">Short bursts to create momentum.</div>
        <div class="price">From $95 / week</div>
        <p class="muted">A focused 1–3 week plan with daily micro-tasks and a weekly check.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
        <h3>Rhythm Coaching</h3>
        <div class="muted" style="margin-bottom:8px">Sustained support for 6–12 weeks.</div>
        <div class="price">Custom packages</div>
        <p class="muted">Biweekly sessions, accountability, and adjusted habit ladders to reach an agreed outcome.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
        <h3>Solo Toolkit</h3>
        <div class="muted" style="margin-bottom:8px">Self-guided templates and checklists.</div>
        <div class="price">One-off $29</div>
        <p class="muted">Printable guides and habit frameworks you can run on your own.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="habit-builder">
      <h3>Create a 7-day challenge</h3>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
        <div style="flex:1">
          <label class="muted">Habit name</label>
          <input id="habitName" placeholder="e.g., Morning calm">
          <label class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Focus</label>
          <input id="habitFocus" placeholder="e.g., breathe 5 min, move 10 min, write 3 lines">
          <label class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Difficulty (1–3)</label>
          <select id="habitDiff"><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option></select>
        </div>
        <div style="width:220px">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Actions</div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px"><button id="genChallenge">Generate</button><button id="copyChecklist" style="background:#333;color:white">Copy</button></div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px"><button id="printBtn" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(208,106,165,0.12);padding:8px;border-radius:8px">Print checklist</button></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="checklistArea" class="checklist" style="margin-top:12px">No checklist yet.</div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px">
      <h3>How we price</h3>
      <p class="muted">We frame pricing around the outcome and time commitment rather than hour-by-hour. Packages are flexible — contact us for a tailored pathway.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(16,32,48,0.03)">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Small case note</h3>
      <div class="muted">A client chose a one-week guided burst. They tracked a 7-day habit, did a 10-minute evening reflection each day, and kept the action under 10 minutes. After two weeks they extended with biweekly coaching.</div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px">
      <h3>Still wondering?</h3>
      <p class="muted">Reach out at <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> or reserve a short call to see which pathway fits your life.</p>
      <a href="book.html"><button style="background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:0">Reserve a quick call</button></a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div class="print-section" id="printBlock"></div>

  <script>
    function generateChallenge(){
      var name = document.getElementById('habitName').value || '7-day habit';
      var focus = document.getElementById('habitFocus').value || 'small daily action';
      var diff = document.getElementById('habitDiff').value;
      var checklist = document.getElementById('checklistArea');
      var list = document.createElement('div');
      var title = document.createElement('div'); title.style.fontWeight='700'; title.textContent = name + ' — ' + focus + ' (difficulty ' + diff + ')';
      list.appendChild(title);
      var ul = document.createElement('ol'); ul.style.marginTop='8px';
      for(var i=1;i<=7;i++){
        var li = document.createElement('li'); li.style.margin='8px 0';
        var cb = document.createElement('input'); cb.type='checkbox'; cb.id='d'+i;
        var lbl = document.createElement('label'); lbl.htmlFor='d'+i; lbl.style.marginLeft='8px'; lbl.textContent = 'Day ' + i + ': ' + focus;
        li.appendChild(cb); li.appendChild(lbl); ul.appendChild(li);
      }
      list.appendChild(ul);
      checklist.innerHTML=''; checklist.appendChild(list);
    }
    document.getElementById('genChallenge').addEventListener('click', generateChallenge);
    document.getElementById('copyChecklist').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var area = document.getElementById('checklistArea');
      if(area.textContent.trim()==='No checklist yet.') return alert('Generate first');
      var lines = [];
      var title = area.querySelector('div').textContent; lines.push(title); lines.push('');
      var items = area.querySelectorAll('ol li label');
      items.forEach(function(l){lines.push('- ' + l.textContent)});
      var txt = lines.join('\n');
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(function(){alert('Checklist copied to clipboard');});
    });
    document.getElementById('printBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var content = document.getElementById('checklistArea').innerHTML;
      if(!content || content.trim()==='No checklist yet.') return alert('Generate a checklist first');
      var w = window.open('','_blank');
      w.document.write('<!doctype html><html><head><title>Checklist</title><style>body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial;padding:20px}</style></head><body>'+content+'</body></html>');
      w.document.close();
      w.print();
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"programs.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Programs — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f8fbff;--ink:#052334;--accent:#3b82f6;--muted:#6c7782}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
    header{padding:14px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:20px auto;padding:18px}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(59,130,246,0.06),transparent);padding:16px;border-radius:10px}
    .tiers{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
    .tier{flex:1;background:white;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(5,35,52,0.04)}
    .tier h3{margin:0}
    .fee{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    .note{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:8px}
    .planner{margin-top:16px;padding:12px;background:white;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.06)}
    input,select,button,textarea{font:inherit}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:0}
    .case-note{margin-top:12px;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(5,35,52,0.03)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Your Story</a>
      <a href="services.html">Pathways</a>
      <a href="programs.html" aria-current="page">Journeys</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Journeys — structured options</h1>
      <p class="note">Each program is a curated rhythm: what you do daily, how we review weekly, and checkpoints to measure progress.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="tiers">
      <div class="tier">
        <h3>Starter Sprint</h3>
        <div class="fee">$95</div>
        <div class="note">1 week guided plan, daily micro-tasks, end-of-week reflection template.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tier">
        <h3>Steady Ladder</h3>
        <div class="fee">$420</div>
        <div class="note">6-week program with biweekly coaching and habit scorecards.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tier">
        <h3>Legacy Flow</h3>
        <div class="fee">Custom</div>
        <div class="note">12+ weeks, tailored structures, ongoing review cadence. Best for lasting rhythm change.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="planner">
      <h3>Session Planner (tailor a plan)</h3>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start">
        <div style="flex:1">
          <label class="muted">Choose program</label>
          <select id="progSelect"><option>Starter Sprint</option><option>Steady Ladder</option><option>Legacy Flow</option></select>
          <label class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Primary outcome</label>
          <input id="outcome" placeholder="e.g., consistent morning routine">
          <label class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Weekly time you can spare</label>
          <select id="weekly"><option>30 min</option><option>1 hour</option><option>2+ hours</option></select>
          <label class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Notes</label>
          <textarea id="progNotes" rows="2"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div style="width:260px">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Personalized summary</div>
          <pre id="summary" style="background:#f0f7ff;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px;height:200px;overflow:auto"></pre>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px"><button id="makeSummary">Make</button><button id="copySummary" style="background:#08325a">Copy</button></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

